      en: ["The stadium's name honors the date of the historic 1958 independence vote.", "It has a seating capacity of approximately 25,000 for international matches.", "It was the primary home ground for Syli National for several decades.", "The stadium is located in the central and bustling Dixinn district.", "It remains a significant site in Guinea's modern political history.", "The facility includes an Olympic-standard track for regional athletics."]
